---
import LegalLayout from '../../components/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updatedAt="July 27, 2026">
  <p>
    Written under the LGPD (Federal Law No. 13,709/2018, Brazil's General
    Data Protection Law). This is the same text presented when you sign up
    in the app — see also our <a href="/en/terms">Terms of Use</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Data we collect and why</h2>
  <p>
    We only collect what the app needs to function (the necessity
    principle, Article 6, III, of the LGPD):
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name, email and password — creating and accessing your account;</li>
    <li>Profile photo (optional) — identifying participants to each other;</li>
    <li>
      Trips, itineraries, expenses and photos you record — providing the
      service.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The legal basis for this processing is contract performance (Article
    7, V, of the LGPD). We do not sell your data or use it for
    advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Sharing within trips</h2>
  <p>
    Vayker is collaborative by nature: once you join a trip, your name,
    profile photo and the records you create (itineraries, expenses,
    balances) become visible to the other participants of that trip — and
    only to them. See how PIN invitations work in our
    <a href="/en/terms">Terms of Use</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Storage and security</h2>
  <p>
    Your data is stored with cloud providers contracted by Vayker, which
    may involve international transfer as described in Article 33 of the
    LGPD. Images are kept in a private repository, accessible only through
    signed, temporary links.
  </p>
  <p>
    We use technical measures consistent with Article 46 of the LGPD and
    Article 13 of Decree No. 8,771/2016 (implementing the Marco Civil da
    Internet), such as encryption in transit and authentication-based
    access control.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Your rights (LGPD)</h2>
  <p>
    Under Article 18 of the LGPD, you can at any time: confirm that
    processing is taking place, access, correct, anonymize or delete your
    data, and withdraw consent.
  </p>
  <p>
    In the app itself you can edit your name and photo (Profile tab) and
    delete your account (Profile → Delete my account). Deletion
    permanently removes your own trips, photos and profile data.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact for data protection requests</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, requests about personal data, or exercising your LGPD
    rights: reach our data protection contact at
    <a href="mailto:app.vayker@gmail.com">app.vayker@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
